## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Architecture

- **Backend:** Python 3.12+ / FastAPI (bound strictly to `127.0.0.1`)
- **Frontend / UI:** Native desktop window via `pywebview` (HTML/CSS/JS)
- **LLM Engine:** [Ollama](https://ollama.com) (Recommended default: `qwen2.5:7b`)
- **Vector Store & Embeddings:** ChromaDB / FAISS / `sentence-transformers`
- **STT / TTS:** `faster-whisper` / Windows SAPI

---

## 💻 System Requirements

- **OS:** Windows 10 / 11
- **Hardware:** NVIDIA GPU with at least 8 GB VRAM (Tested on RTX 3050 8GB)
- **Software:** - [Python 3.12+](https://www.python.org/)
  - [Ollama](https://ollama.com) with at least one pulled model (e.g., `ollama pull qwen2.5`)

